==Description==
The '''Tough Cookie''' was a large enemy that appeared on Wave 10 in [[Cold Ambush]] as part of the [[Violent Night Event]]. It had a high amount of health, but it had a slightly slow walk speed.

==Appearance==
The '''Tough Cookie''' was a toasted dark brown gingerbread man. It was a large figure that had a waist and lower arms in its rig. It had a cylindrical head with what appeared to have a bite taken out of it. It also had an frown on its face and three dots made of white icing on its torso, presumably buttons.

==Strategy==
*High DPS towers like the [[Golden Minigunner]], [[Ranger]], [[Accelerator]] or [[Engineer]] are recommended against this.
**Additionally, you can use towers such as [[Commander]] and [[DJ Booth]] to boost these towers.

